\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  If Jesus Christ is in your home
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 And He is found in all your deeds,
\par Your house is blessed indeed to be
\par Perpetual light, and life, and peace
\par \pard\li180\sl20\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Father is blessed, so is mother,
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 And children through their unflinching faith;
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0\qj  And the love which they have for God
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0  For which they receive God's blessing
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He whose house is perfect is blessed,
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 It's exemplary to the world
\par If not for God's mercifulness
\par All our toil would have been in vain
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Whatever there is day by day
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0\qj Those who abide by the word of God;
\par Those who adhere to righteousness
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1  \cf0 Will ever get God's blessings
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. All the united families
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  Have the most progressive members
\par  In all their recognized good works,
\par  They get spiritual blessings too
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. All parents who have faith are blessed;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  Bringing up children and grand children;
\par  them through the fear of God direct;
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0\qj  Will prevent them from all evil
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. The father of the house is blessed,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 So is the mother and children,
\par For God's blessing is upon them,
\par With multitude of descendants
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Therefore and I all my household,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj We strongly vow and pledge today, \tab 
\par That even if all despise God,
\par \pard       We shall serve Him, and praise His Name.\tab\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

